# Day files

## Naming

`fase-n/<subject>/dia-NN-slug.md` (zero-padded day number + kebab slug).

Subjects: `fisica`, `matematica`, `quimica`, `portugues`, `ingles`.

## Required headings (PT-BR, exact)

```markdown
# Dia NN — Título

## Meta
## Links
## Teoria
## Exercícios
## Gabarito
```

## Links

- Prefer a curated YouTube `Vídeoaula` first
- No error-log folder links in the day flow

## Content

- Meta: one clear goal
- Teoria: concise
- Exercícios: numbered, printable on paper
- Gabarito: short; never fabricate official ITA keys
